# PaperPilot — Original Idea

I want to make an agentic project. Its about Research papers. Its a one stop platform for research scholars. There you can discover undiscovered novel topics to do research on in a specific domain like google scholar, suggest the approach of that research, the tools, novel algos, training, datasets to use for that research etc. Suggest research papers to refer to for the research work (papers must be from IEEE). These were the basic feature.

THE MAIN features: when submitted the research work done, the graphs, the plots and the results generated from that research, when submitted to the agent it would tell if the research is publishable (by looking at the novelty and the extent of research), grade the work out of 10 on specific topics like novelty etc, and suggest the improvements like further research and seed increase etc. Then further if the user wants to write the paper on the research conducted, the user would just submit the research work (files, results, plots, reference papers etc) and select the type of venue we are targeting, and the agent would write a proper paper for it according to the given files and venue (the agent will make sure no blank spaces are there in the paper, consistency of flow, not hallucination, and most importantly it will be humanized).

